@startuml
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontSize 12
start
:Input snapshot + old state;
if (any input missing?) then (yes)
  :Reject input\n(if absence matters, host sends\nan explicit fault/status input);
  stop
endif
:Evaluate all next expressions\n(read old state + inputs)\n-> one candidate state;
:Evaluate intents\n(unprimed state = old;\nnext.NAME = candidate);
:Safety constraints\n(requires, mutex)\nrequested -> safe intents;
:No evaluation error:\ncommit together\ncandidate state + requested/safe intents;
:Journal: inputs, old/new state,\nboth intents, strategy, faults;
stop
@enduml
